  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#fan2021"><z:itemType>journalArticle</z:itemType><dc:title>Thin-film neural networks for optical inverse problem</dc:title><dc:creator>Fan et al.</dc:creator><dc:date>2021</dc:date><dc:identifier>DOI 10.37188/lam.2021.027</dc:identifier><dc:subject>SiC 外延层厚度确定研究</dc:subject><dc:description>神经网络薄膜反演方向；暂不进入主模型。</dc:description></rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#lininger2021"><z:itemType>journalArticle</z:itemType><dc:title>General Inverse Design of Layered Thin-Film Materials with Convolutional Neural Networks</dc:title><dc:creator>Lininger et al.</dc:creator><dc:date>2021</dc:date><dc:identifier>DOI 10.1021/acsphotonics.1c01498</dc:identifier><dc:identifier>arXiv 2104.01952</dc:identifier><dc:subject>SiC 外延层厚度确定研究</dc:subject><dc:description>CNN 逆设计、仿真谱训练；暂不进入主模型。</dc:description></rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#tian2020"><z:itemType>conferencePaper</z:itemType><dc:title>Rapid and Accurate Thin Film Thickness Extraction via UV-Vis and Machine Learning</dc:title><dc:creator>Tian et al.</dc:creator><dc:date>2020</dc:date><dc:identifier>DOI 10.1109/PVSC45281.2020.9300634</dc:identifier><dc:subject>SiC 外延层厚度确定研究</dc:subject><dc:description>机器学习厚度预测背景；本题样本太少，不能直接训练。</dc:description></rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#tian2022"><z:itemType>preprint</z:itemType><dc:title>Tackling Data Scarcity with Transfer Learning</dc:title><dc:creator>Tian et al.</dc:creator><dc:date>2022</dc:date><dc:identifier>DOI 10.48550/arXiv.2207.02209</dc:identifier><dc:subject>SiC 外延层厚度确定研究</dc:subject><dc:description>数据稀缺与迁移学习背景；只作未来方向。</dc:description></rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#marquez2021"><z:itemType>journalArticle</z:itemType><dc:title>Optical Characterization of H-Free a-Si Layers</dc:title><dc:creator>Marquez et al.</dc:creator><dc:date>2021</dc:date><dc:identifier>DOI 10.3390/coatings11111324</dc:identifier><dc:subject>SiC 外延层厚度确定研究</dc:subject><dc:description>光学常数参数化背景；材料体系不同。</dc:description></rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#minkov2021"><z:itemType>journalArticle</z:itemType><dc:title>Further Increasing the Accuracy...</dc:title><dc:creator>Minkov et al.</dc:creator><dc:date>2021</dc:date><dc:identifier>DOI 10.3390/ma14164681</dc:identifier><dc:subject>SiC 外延层厚度确定研究</dc:subject><dc:description>干涉谱波段选择、厚度精度背景；待核验具体方法。</dc:description></rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#jena2021"><z:itemType>journalArticle</z:itemType><dc:title>Transfer matrix based reverse engineering approach...</dc:title><dc:creator>Jena et al.</dc:creator><dc:date>2021</dc:date><dc:identifier>DOI 10.1016/j.optlastec.2021.107392</dc:identifier><dc:subject>SiC 外延层厚度确定研究</dc:subject><dc:description>TMM 反演背景；材料体系不同。</dc:description></rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="#jan2021"><z:itemType>journalArticle</z:itemType><dc:title>Optical interference system for simultaneously measuring refractive index and thickness...</dc:title><dc:creator>Jan et al.</dc:creator><dc:date>2021</dc:date><dc:identifier>DOI 10.1016/j.optlaseng.2021.106668</dc:identifier><dc:subject>SiC 外延层厚度确定研究</dc:subject><dc:description>折射率和厚度同步估计背景；待核验。</dc:description></rdf:Description>

